  "title": "eToro Group Reports Selected May Business Metrics",
  "summary": "New York – June 8, 2026 – eToro Group Ltd. (“eToro”, or the “Company”) (NASDAQ: ETOR), the trading and investing platform, is reporting the below selected monthly business metrics for May 2026. Assets under Administration (AUA) were $20.1B, up 18% year-over-year. Funded Accounts* were 4.23M, up 17% year-over-year. Capital Markets/ECC Activity Total number of trades was 64.0M, up 59% year-over-year; Invested amount per trade was $201, down 36% year-over-year; …",
